# NOTE: The dynamic-bonding feature this example was written for (the old
# "nlist ... bonding" + "extraforce ... lewis" commands) is NOT available in
# the current MATILDA.FT source tree, so the original dynamic-binding run
# cannot be reproduced.  This input is a best-effort modernization that runs
# the same 10-particle system as a plain soft-sphere (Gaussian) melt so the
# example at least exercises the current input format.  See README.txt.
box ps
Dim 3
grid 25 25 25

logFreq 100
gsdFreq 1000
trajFreq 10
pmeorder 1

species A

readData input.data

integrator all GJF delt 0.002

potential gaussian A A 1.0 1.0
endBox

run nvt 10000
